00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:23.800
But how many of you have
an app in production

00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:25.970
or near going into production?

00:00:25.970 --> 00:00:29.170
There's a few, but not too many.

00:00:29.170 --> 00:00:32.085
So we're going to
