00:00:32.085 --> 00:00:33.460
The first thing
we're going to do

00:00:33.460 --> 00:00:35.830
is we're going to give
a quick whirlwind tour

00:00:35.830 --> 00:00:38.710
of Flutter, why we think
it's good for building apps.

00:00:38.710 --> 00:00:41.290
And we're going to take a
little peek under the hood.

00:00:41.290 --> 00:00:43.280
We'll do that for
