what I was trying to do.

00:24:00.126 --> 00:24:02.840
And the reason I'm doing this,
it leads into the next thing.

00:24:02.840 --> 00:24:05.080
The list of cream
stores, wouldn't it

00:24:05.080 --> 00:24:07.290
