types everything in for me.

00:24:18.020 --> 00:24:22.300
So who here has done CSS
three star Flexboxes?

00:24:22.300 --> 00:24:23.030
Couple of you?

00:24:23.030 --> 00:24:23.830
Oh, good.

00:24:23.830 --> 00:24:25.820
We've got some web developers.

00:24:25.820 --> 00:24:30.320
So you'll be pleased to
know that-- oh, yeah.

00:24:30.320 --> 00:24:33.280
Remember how I said, we
had a StoreList before?

00:24:33.280 --> 00:24:34.780
We went through and built that.

00:24:34.780 --> 00:24:38.170
I built a matching
StoreMap, which is

00:24:38.170 --> 00:24:40.510
