00:24:40.510 --> 00:24:42.950
And we'll add some more
code to that in a minute.

00:24:42.950 --> 00:24:47.470
But the part I'm talking
about is here in the column,

00:24:47.470 --> 00:24:49.210
this column replaces
the earlier thing

00:24:49.210 --> 00:24:51.100
where we just had a StoreList.

00:24:51.100 --> 00:24:54.810
And because this column is
