Excellent.

00:25:24.268 --> 00:25:25.060
BRETT MORGAN: Boom.

00:25:25.060 --> 00:25:26.310
We have some ice cream stores.

00:25:29.200 --> 00:25:30.930
So we can click on them.

00:25:30.930 --> 00:25:31.890
