00:25:39.660 --> 00:25:40.490
OK.

00:25:40.490 --> 00:25:42.190
Let's include some
more functionality.

00:25:42.190 --> 00:25:44.660
And this time, I'm
including dot async

00:25:44.660 --> 00:25:46.740
Why am I including dot async?

00:25:46.740 --> 00:25:50.470
OK, so what am I creating here
is a thing called a completer.

00:25:50.470 --> 00:25:54.590
And a completer is an
asynchronous communication

00:25:54.590 --> 00:25:55.390
channel.

00:25:55.390 --> 00:25:58.352
Because I have an
interesting problem in that

00:25:58.352 --> 00:25:59.810
I want this list
down at the bottom

00:25:59.810 --> 00:26:03.290
here, when I click on
it, to control the map.

00:26:03.290 --> 00:26:06.980
And the map gives us a way to
do it, a GoogleMapController.

00:26:06.980 --> 00:26:09.800
But the map, Google Map,
doesn't give it to us

00:26:09.800 --> 00:26:13.040
until after it's on the screen,
which is too late to hand it

00:26:13.040 --> 00:26:14.250
to the ListView.

00:26:14.250 --> 00:26:17.940
So effectively, I'm handing the
ListView this sort of token.

00:26:17.940 --> 00:26:19.790
This says, some
point in the future,

00:26:19.790 --> 00:26:24.070
this thing will resolve or
complete to a Google Map.

00:26:24.070 --> 00:26:26.620
So let's turn around
and do some more typing.

00:26:28.940 --> 00:26:30.190
And here's the important part.

00:26:33.600 --> 00:26:35.550
When the map is
created, we turn around

00:26:35.550 --> 00:26:39.400
and complete that completer
with a Google Map.

00:26:39.400 --> 00:26:41.890
But because I've created
things out of order,

00:26:41.890 --> 00:26:43.910
I just need to reload my app.

00:26:47.290 --> 00:26:49.640
Our completer is now loaded.

00:26:49.640 --> 00:26:52.610
Let's turn around and
fill in the StoreList.

00:26:52.610 --> 00:26:54.140
So we're adding
some functionalities

00:26:54.140 --> 00:27:00.990
to this abstraction
such that when

00:27:00.990 --> 00:27:02.847
we tap on one of
the ListTiles, it

00:27:02.847 --> 00:27:05.430
will turn around and go to the
latitude and longitude of where

00:27:05.430 --> 00:27:06.780
