00:27:06.780 --> 00:27:11.940
So let's say we want to go
to CREAM San Francisco, yes!

00:27:11.940 --> 00:27:13.300
We're done, right?

00:27:13.300 --> 00:27:13.480
MATTHEW SULLIVAN: Are we?

00:27:13.480 --> 00:27:13.920
Good.

00:27:13.920 --> 00:27:14.400
BRETT MORGAN: Oh, OK.

00:27:14.400 --> 00:27:14.980
Let's do it some more.

00:27:14.980 --> 00:27:16.647
